# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this tutorial we use a real-world biological dataset for a binary classification task, which is generated by Daniels et al. (2022) and can be downloaded from the  [supplementary material](https://www.science.org/doi/full/10.1126/science.abq0225#supplementary-materials) included with the paper. The data consists of CAR T-cells, which are genetically engineered T-cells used in immunotherapy to treat certain cancers. T-cells, a type of immune cell, are modified in a lab to express chimeric antigen receptors (CARs) that target specific proteins on cancer cells. These modified T-cells can recognize and destroy cancer cells more effectively. The data features are the CAR T-cell motifs, which refer to the specific structural or functional component of the CAR engineered into T-cells. Based on these motifs, our task is to predict the cytotoxicity of a given CAR T-cell, labeling it as either toxic or non-toxic.\n"
"The following shows the helper functions to preprocess this dataset.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa tutorial na ito, gumagamit tayo ng isang tunay na biological dataset para sa isang binary classification na gawain, na nabuo nina Daniels et al. (2022) at maaaring i-download mula sa [supplementary material](https://www.science.org/doi/full/10.1126/science.abq0225#supplementary-materials) na kasama ng papel. Ang data ay binubuo ng mga CAR T-cell, na mga genetically engineered T-cell na ginagamit sa immunotherapy upang gamutin ang ilang mga kanser. Ang mga T-cell, isang uri ng immune cell, ay binabago sa laboratoryo upang magpahayag ng mga chimeric antigen receptor (CAR) na nagta-target ng mga tiyak na protina sa mga cancer cell. Ang mga binagong T-cell na ito ay makakakilala at makakasira ng mga cancer cell nang mas epektibo. Ang mga feature ng data ay ang mga CAR T-cell motif, na tumutukoy sa tiyak na istruktura o functional na bahagi ng CAR na naka-engineer sa mga T-cell. Batay sa mga motif na ito, ang aming gawain ay hulaan ang cytotoxicity ng isang ibinigay na CAR T-cell, ina-label ito bilang toxic o non-toxic.\n"
"Ipinapakita ng sumusunod ang mga helper function upang i-preprocess ang dataset na ito.\n"

